     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Now you can enjoy the game using your favorite gamepad. In the release version of the game, it will be possible to control the cursor using a stick. We have also added a stick drift adjustment, allowing you to adjust the sensitivity and control accuracy to your preferences.",
